# 22. Our Database Relationship

The database currently follows this structure:

```text
             CollegeDB
                 |
        -------------------
        |                 |
   Department           Student
        |                 |
   dept_id  <--------  dept_id
   dept_name           student_id
                       name
                       age
                       email
                       marks
```

The important relationship is:

```text
Department.dept_id
        ↑
        |
Student.dept_id
```

This is a **one-to-many relationship**:

> One department can have many students.
